{{- /*
The "builder-test" template renders the companion test file. It
runs against the same Data passed to "builder", except PackageName
/ Imports / GenQualifier are reshaped via [generator.BuildTestFileInfo]
so the test lives in the sibling test package and references the
generated builders via $.GenQualifier.

Composes:

  - "header"            — package + import block + file-level doc
  - "builder-test-type" — one Test<Type>Builder function per struct,
                          with subtests covering the contract every
                          builder honors (round-trip, With*, Append*,
                          Mutate, Clone) plus shape-specific subtests.
*/ -}}
{{define "builder-test"}}
{{template "header" .}}
{{- range $s := .Structs}}
{{template "builder-test-type" (dict "Type" $s "Local" $)}}
{{- end}}
{{end}}
